{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadowbound</strong> is a journey through minimalist 3D environments, where light is your enemy and shadow your only ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has always been grey. You walk aimlessly, searching for a place to stop, rest, and leave the bad behind so you can move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a short, direct challenge with no distractions: jump, advance, and reach the shadow that will allow you to continue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong><br>\u00b7 Shadow is your only ally, and light is your enemy.<br>\u00b7 Minimalist black-and-white environments.<br>\u00b7 Short, direct levels with no distractions.<br>\u00b7 Puzzles that play with light and shadow.<br>\u00b7 Motivational phrases between worlds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950950?t=1757444936","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950950/649da49cee9412f662a799bfe7b8aebafddb2e61/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757444936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950950/f47750c3804bdddf552fb76109e71154204facf9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757444936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950950/f47750c3804bdddf552fb76109e71154204facf9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757444936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadowbound</strong> is a journey through minimalist 3D environments, where light is your enemy and shadow your only ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has always 